  "label": "Thanksgiving dinner scene is mapped as 'thanksgiving in china'",
  "description": "The visual material depicting a traditional American Thanksgiving dinner (roasted turkey, corn, green beans, etc.) is juxtaposed with the text 'thanksgiving in china'. This creates an analogical mapping where the visual scene (a Thanksgiving dinner) is being mapped onto the textual concept of 'thanksgiving in china', implying that the scene represents a Thanksgiving celebration occurring in China. This mapping is central to the meme's satirical intent, suggesting a cultural mismatch or absurdity by placing an American holiday within a Chinese context.",
